---
layout: prototype-base.njk
title: "Prototype B — Creative Desktop Archive"
description: "Experimental index와 겹치는 interactive desktop windows를 균형 있게 결합한 somani 블로그 디자인 시안 B"
permalink: /prototypes/creative-desktop/
prototypeClass: prototype-b
noindex: true
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
{% set editorialTopics = [topics[1], topics[0], topics[2], topics[3], topics[4], topics[5]] %}
<div class="b-composition">
  <section class="b-editorial-column" aria-labelledby="b-title" data-reveal>
    <p class="prototype-kicker">PROTOTYPE B / CREATIVE DESKTOP ARCHIVE</p>
    <h1 id="b-title"><span>somani's</span><span>living</span><span>archive.</span></h1>
    <div class="b-intro">
      <p><strong>안녕하세요, somani입니다.</strong> 시스템 해킹과 리버싱을 중심으로 CTF와 개발 과정에서 배우고 경험한 것들을 기록합니다.</p>
      <p class="discipline-line">System Hacking · Reversing · CTF · Development</p>
    </div>
    <div class="b-index-heading"><span>INDEX</span><span>06 fields / {{ collections.posts | length }} published note</span></div>
    <ol class="b-index" aria-label="카테고리 인덱스">
      {% for category in editorialTopics %}
      <li><a href="/categories/{{ category.slug }}/"><span>0{{ loop.index }}</span><strong>{{ category.name }}</strong><em>{{ category.label }}</em><i>↗</i></a></li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ol>
    <div class="b-editorial-links"><a href="/archive/">Search the archive ↗</a><a href="/about/">About somani ↗</a></div>
  </section>

  <section class="b-workspace" aria-labelledby="b-workspace-title" data-reveal>
    <header class="b-workspace-heading"><div><p class="prototype-kicker">DESKTOP / THREE VIEWS</p><h2 id="b-workspace-title">A working space<br>for things I learn.</h2></div><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></header>
    <div class="workspace-switcher" role="group" aria-label="작업창 선택">
      <button type="button" aria-pressed="true" data-window-target="b-profile-window">01 Profile</button>
      <button type="button" aria-pressed="false" data-window-target="b-note-window">02 Latest</button>
      <button type="button" aria-pressed="false" data-window-target="b-project-window">03 Project</button>
    </div>
    <div class="window-stage" data-window-stage>
      <article class="desktop-window b-profile-window is-active" id="b-profile-window" data-window tabindex="-1">
        <header class="window-titlebar"><span>somani.profile</span><a href="/about/">About ↗</a></header>
        <div class="b-profile-body"><img src="{{ profile.image }}" alt="{{ profile.imageAlt }}" width="736" height="781"><div><p class="window-overline">ICT CONVERGENCE</p><h3>Hello, I'm somani.</h3><p>{{ profile.affiliation }}</p><p>System Hacking / Reversing / CTF / Development</p></div></div>
      </article>

      {% for post in collections.posts | take(1) %}
      <article class="desktop-window b-note-window" id="b-note-window" data-window tabindex="-1">
        <header class="window-titlebar"><span>latest.note</span><time datetime="{{ post.date | dateISO }}">{{ post.date | dateISO }}</time></header>
        <div class="b-note-body"><p class="window-overline">{{ post.data.categories[0] }} / {{ post.data.tags | join(' · ') }}</p><h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3><p>{{ post.data.description }}</p><a class="prototype-arrow-link" href="/prototypes/creative-desktop/github-pages-blog/">Open note <span>↗</span></a></div>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}

      {% for project in projects | take(1) %}
      <article class="desktop-window b-project-window" id="b-project-window" data-window tabindex="-1">
        <header class="window-titlebar"><span>selected.work</span><a href="{{ project.repository }}">GitHub ↗</a></header>
        <div class="b-project-body"><p class="window-overline">PROJECT / 01</p><h3>{{ project.name }}</h3><p>{{ project.description }}</p><div class="mini-stack">{% for technology in project.stack %}<span>{{ technology }}</span>{% endfor %}</div><a class="prototype-arrow-link" href="{{ project.post }}">Build record <span>↗</span></a></div>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <div class="stage-status"><span><i></i> workspace ready</span><span>Click a numbered view to bring it forward.</span></div>
  </section>
</div>
